# signalled and the buffer comes back 49152 frames where the test wants 47040. half-a-second-8000.mp3
# resamples 8000 -> 48000 and lands 5 frames short of 24000. Both counts are the decoder's own shape,
# measured identically on WK1 and WK2; upstream's GStreamer port records the same two under this bug.
